Brethren,
We will be conducting a Fellow Craft Degree for Brother Rob Loebl on Tuesda=
y, September 29. A rehearsal is scheduled for Tuesday, September 15. I have=
 included the planned cast below. If you are unable to participate, please =
let me know as soon as possible so I can fill your position.
We will also be conducting a Fellow Craft Military Degree for Brother Romeo=
 on Tuesday, October 20. I hope you will be able to attend both degrees and=
 support our Brothers as they continue their Masonic journeys.
Additionally, Adobe Lodge will make an official visit to Nelson Bledsoe Lod=
ge No. 74 next Tuesday, September 8. We will gather for dinner at 6:00 p.m.=
, followed by their stated meeting at 7:00 p.m. Although no charge was ment=
ioned, please be prepared to make a small donation for dinner.In keeping wi=
th Adobe=E2=80=99s custom when traveling as a Lodge, please wear a black su=
it. Nelson Bledsoe meets in casual attire, but we will maintain our traditi=
onal traveling dress.=C2=A0Please let me know if you plan to attend so I ca=
n provide the Lodge with an estimated dinner count. Let us make this a stro=
ng showing of Adobe members and demonstrate our support for our fellow Maso=
ns.
Fraternally,
Will
Second Degree
WM/G Lecture =E2=80=93 Sean
SW =E2=80=93 Will
JW =E2=80=93 Ron
SD/Lecture =E2=80=93 Darren
JD =E2=80=93 Eli
SS =E2=80=93 Moe
JS =E2=80=93 Jeff
Marshall - Nick
Secretary =E2=80=93 Mike G
Treasurer =E2=80=93 Tanner
Charge =E2=80=93 Eli
Chap =E2=80=93 Kenn
Tyler- Bob K
